  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.17,
      "end_seconds": 4.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "Hi doctor, am I too early?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.34,
      "end_seconds": 9.87,
      "duration_seconds": 4.53,
      "text": "You're alright, take a seat. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 11.14,
      "end_seconds": 20.67,
      "duration_seconds": 9.53,
      "text": "Erm, doctor, I've come along because I know the history, if it helps. We came because of a stooped back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.55,
      "end_seconds": 24.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "Let me quickly check your readings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.59,
      "end_seconds": 35.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.01,
      "end_seconds": 56.88,
      "duration_seconds": 6.87,
      "text": "Okay: respiratory rate 17, blood pressure 111 over 75, pulse 71. When did this begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 57.94,
      "end_seconds": 59.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "Probably three weeks. Yeah."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.31,
      "end_seconds": 65.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.88,
      "text": "Okay, go on. So, how strong would you say it is?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.8,
      "end_seconds": 68.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "I'd say moderate."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.86,
      "end_seconds": 71.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Does anything else come with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 71.95,
      "end_seconds": 102.24,
      "duration_seconds": 30.29,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get pain in my lower back as well. Okay, you know, so the pain in my lower back? That's been for about a year. With pain in my lower back, about a three out of ten. Honestly, once or twice a day. I mean, and there's a painful wrist as well, three weeks now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.65,
      "end_seconds": 106.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "Is it constant or in episodes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.59,
      "end_seconds": 111.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "I'd say a few times a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.27,
      "end_seconds": 118.86,
      "duration_seconds": 6.59,
      "text": "Okay, go on. Have you had a stooped back before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.87,
      "end_seconds": 126.04,
      "duration_seconds": 5.17,
      "text": "A bit, last year. It settled by itself back then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.97,
      "end_seconds": 143.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "Have you noticed numbness in the legs or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.35,
      "end_seconds": 147.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "No, I'd have said so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.05,
      "end_seconds": 153.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "text": "and what about weight loss, night pain or bladder problems?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.19,
      "end_seconds": 159.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "No, no weight loss, night pain or bladder problems."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.52,
      "end_seconds": 164.85,
      "duration_seconds": 4.33,
      "text": "What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.71,
      "end_seconds": 168.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "right, bowels are regular, nothing odd"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.65,
      "end_seconds": 171.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "Anything unusual with passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 172.57,
      "end_seconds": 175.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "No, um, that's all fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.0,
      "end_seconds": 182.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 184.26,
      "end_seconds": 187.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "yes, wheat, it gives me bloating"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.75,
      "end_seconds": 190.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "Any surgery in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 195.62,
      "end_seconds": 201.0,
      "duration_seconds": 5.38,
      "text": "Actually, yes, I had part of my thyroid removed, years back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.72,
      "end_seconds": 221.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "Tell me your medicines, please."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 222.34,
      "end_seconds": 233.25,
      "duration_seconds": 10.91,
      "text": "sorry, what was I saying, she is on alendronate, 70 milligrams, once a week for my bones, I give it to her"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.55,
      "end_seconds": 234.38,
      "duration_seconds": 0.83,
      "text": "Mm-hmm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 236.0,
      "end_seconds": 239.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "she takes thyroxine, 75 micrograms, every morning"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.5,
      "end_seconds": 245.91,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 247.47,
      "end_seconds": 265.04,
      "duration_seconds": 17.57,
      "text": "I have thin bones. I've got an underactive thyroid. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it. It's the not knowing that gets to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.86,
      "end_seconds": 279.35,
      "duration_seconds": 8.49,
      "text": "okay, I can see thin bones and an underactive thyroid in your file as well now some background about your lifestyle"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 281.2,
      "end_seconds": 293.93,
      "duration_seconds": 12.73,
      "text": "I smoke roughly a pack every two days. Nothing, I'm teetotal. I'm vegetarian and have been for years. I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.25,
      "end_seconds": 300.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "Alright, over here please and I'll take a look."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 308.13,
      "end_seconds": 308.83,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "right"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 310.68,
      "end_seconds": 312.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "Tell me if that's sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 321.0,
      "end_seconds": 327.77,
      "duration_seconds": 6.77,
      "text": "There is tenderness over the mid lower spine and no weakness in the legs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 331.33,
      "end_seconds": 365.19,
      "duration_seconds": 33.86,
      "text": "okay, that's enough for me. So, based on the history and the examination, it points towards thin bones with a fragility fracture and back pain. I'd also keep a spinal compression fracture in mind. Let's book blood tests to look into bone health. Take the weekly tablet first thing with a full glass of water and stay upright for half an hour. I'd like you to see the falls clinic as well, and I'll write the referral"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 366.07,
      "end_seconds": 369.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 370.45,
      "end_seconds": 373.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "No, that's all. Thanks a lot."
    }
  ]
}